{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-25T19:28:10.245Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"Published to [wumianyang233/BIOM5350-CDH17-Analysis](https://github.com/wumianyang233/BIOM5350-CDH17-Analysis).\n\n- SSH authentication succeeded; the remote was empty before publishing.\n- Commit: `9ba361662cdacb15dc577a1cd0838c4a2d3d2c85` — `Add reproducible CDH17 expression analysis pipeline`\n- `main` now tracks `origin/main`. Remote verification found **20 files**, including the README, scripts, EDA notebook, Figures A–D, results, dataset, requirements, reproducibility guide, and AI implementation-plan document.\n- The CoCalc chat transcript and raw all-sample intermediate CSV are absent from the remote tree.\n- Final local Git status is clean and synchronized with `origin/main`.\n\nI also published the commit card in this CoCalc chat.","date":"2026-11-25T19:28:51.202Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/P00_Final_Project/CDH17_Analysis/CDH17 Final Project.chat","acp_log_key":"a1f6a6c4-739f-4038-8c65-03a0014e0e3e:cedb6605-8971-46ed-a1ce-329a8f4f0d85","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.a1f6a6c4-739f-4038-8c65-03a0014e0e3e.cedb6605-8971-46ed-a1ce-329a8f4f0d85","acp_started_at_ms":1795634891189,"acp_working_directory":"/home/user/P00_Final_Project/CDH17_Analysis","acp_account_id":"6b19db69-db29-4124-a317-7e98612efdde","acp_runtime_kind":"codex","message_id":"cedb6605-8971-46ed-a1ce-329a8f4f0d85","thread_id":"a1f6a6c4-739f-4038-8c65-03a0014e0e3e","parent_message_id":"e2a30b16-880d-42db-89bc-85edeefdaf94","acp_thread_id":"01a213a4-fe33-7541-be04-ae44f8966e75","acp_usage":{"input_tokens":57502,"cached_input_tokens":55439,"output_tokens":287,"reasoning_output_tokens":94,"total_tokens":57789,"model_context_window":121600},"acp_manager_finished":true,"acp_active_descendant_thread_ids":[],"acp_active_descendant_agents":0,"acp_subagent_limit_exceeded":false,"acp_background_terminal_processes":0