{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-25T19:36:43.474Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"I could not safely create a complete Markdown export, so I stopped before staging or committing.\n\nThe supported CoCalc CLI can list chat threads and fetch assistant activity logs, but the activity endpoint returned only one queued-status event for the latest assistant message—not the user prompts and AI responses. The browser file listing exposed no chat UI session to check for a built-in export. I did not parse the `.chat` file’s internal format or reconstruct the conversation from partial context.\n\n`ai_documentation/AI_CHAT_HISTORY.md` was not created. The original `CDH17 Final Project.chat` remains in the project root; I did not directly edit, move, or delete it. No transcript was exported or published, and no commit or push was made. Git remains clean at commit `9ba361662cdacb15dc577a1cd0838c4a2d3d2c85`.\n\nThe safe next options are to use an official export from the CoCalc chat UI, if available, or ask whether the course accepts the original `.chat` file. I have not scanned the transcript for secrets because no export was produced.","date":"2026-11-25T19:37:31.195Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/P00_Final_Project/CDH17_Analysis/CDH17 Final Project.chat","acp_log_key":"a1f6a6c4-739f-4038-8c65-03a0014e0e3e:d98ab540-19fe-46a0-9c3e-6cba38ca7297","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.a1f6a6c4-739f-4038-8c65-03a0014e0e3e.d98ab540-19fe-46a0-9c3e-6cba38ca7297","acp_started_at_ms":1795635404020,"acp_working_directory":"/home/user/P00_Final_Project/CDH17_Analysis","acp_account_id":"6b19db69-db29-4124-a317-7e98612efdde","acp_runtime_kind":"codex","message_id":"d98ab540-19fe-46a0-9c3e-6cba38ca7297","thread_id":"a1f6a6c4-739f-4038-8c65-03a0014e0e3e","parent_message_id":"00267bff-87d9-4b8d-9fd5-d41d4729d420","acp_thread_id":"01a213a4-fe33-7541-be04-ae44f8966e75","acp_usage":{"input_tokens":6